### IntelliJ HTTP Client - open this file and click the green ▶ next to each request.
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

### ---------- PUBLIC ----------

### List services
GET {{base}}/api/services

### Service by slug
GET {{base}}/api/services/web-development

### List projects
GET {{base}}/api/projects

### Project by slug
GET {{base}}/api/projects/oness-infra-construction-platform

### Submit contact form
POST {{base}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@company.com",
  "phone": "+91 98765 43210",
  "company": "Acme Pvt Ltd",
  "projectType": "Web Development",
  "message": "We need a customer portal built with React and Spring Boot."
}

### ---------- ADMIN ----------

### Login (copies token into {{token}})
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@cognivasoftwares.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List enquiries (filter: status=NEW|IN_PROGRESS|CONTACTED|CLOSED|SPAM, q=search text)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/enquiries?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enquiry counts by status
GET {{base}}/api/admin/enquiries/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update enquiry status / notes
PATCH {{base}}/api/admin/enquiries/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONTACTED",
  "adminNotes": "Called on Monday, sending proposal."
}

### All services incl. unpublished
GET {{base}}/api/admin/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a project
POST {{base}}/api/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "sample-project",
  "title": "Sample Project",
  "industry": "Retail",
  "description": "A sample case study.",
  "tags": ["React", "Spring Boot", "PostgreSQL"],
  "accent": "emerald",
  "solution": ["Point one", "Point two"],
  "displayOrder": 90,
  "published": false
}
